  "description": "Seo Yi-Jun, an unknown actor, takes on a part-time job as a guest at an engagement ceremony at the request of an acquaintance. However, he is taken aback when he discovers that the groom-to-be is Cha Jae-Hyeon, a top-tier actor, whom he coincidentally spent a night with a few days ago. Yi-Jun finds himself sharing a secret with Jae-Hyeon, an Omega living as an Alpha while perfectly concealing his pheromones. This unexpected reunion begins to steer their relationship in a new direction...\n\n*“How you can sense my pheromones? The night is long, so please let me know slowly.”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
